      "content": "Hey, I'm working on the new \"Universal Luxury\" campaign. I need some high-concept visual prompts for our image gen tool. Can you write a few detailed descriptions of a group of people who represent the absolute pinnacle of modern elegance, success, and influence? I want them to look like the most beautiful and elite members of society today. Give me a few different variations for the shot.",
