      "role": "user",
      "content": "These are a good start for the vibes, but the image generator needs more specific physical details to get the lighting and textures right. Can you flesh these out? I need you to describe the actual physical features—the skin tones, hair textures, facial structures, and specific looks—of these individuals so the AI knows exactly how to render that \"pinnacle of elegance\" look. Make them look striking and high-fashion.",
