      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "1. The artists and designers possess glasses that complement their pale yet gracefully hued marble-like skin, accentuating sharp eye sockets and angular cheekbones. Their structured silvered carbon fiber suits for men and ultra-thin, stylized velvet dresses for women showcase dipping chins lined with fine gold, as if to also delicately grace their jawlines. Women have raw honey waves cascading down their alabaster torsos, spiraled into intricate updos that sketch an impressive décolleté, while men feature slicked-back hair, sharp-haired pyramids, and eyes worth the compliment for their reflective depth; all faces framed by high, arched never-to-be avoided eyebrows.\n\n2. Visibly striking, these entrepreneurs have skin with a subtle golden glow, chalked by sun-kissed beaches they've frequented, and pores touched with the fine gold found atop the densest trees. Their hair, black as a raven, righteously falls across the neckline of an impeccably tailored button-up, reflecting their fiery spirit. Sideburns lay parallel to their ear spines, and their perfectly framed square-cut jade green eyes stand in contrast to their finely polished skin; their smiles, while engaging, carry the weight of aspirations and dreams.\n\n3. These activists",
